#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.post_display
msgid ""
"<b class=\"d-block \">This answer has been flagged</b>\n"
"                            As a moderator, you can either validate or "
"reject this answer."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"d-block \">ຄຳຕອບນີ້ຖືກໝາຍລາຍງານ</b>\n"
"                            ໃນຖານະຜູ້ຄວບຄຸມ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບຢືນຢັນ ຫຼື ປະຕິເສດຄຳຕອບນີ້ໄ"
"ດ້."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.post_description_full
msgid ""
"<b class=\"d-block\">You have a pending post</b>\n"
"                        Please wait for a moderator to validate your "
"previous post to be allowed replying questions."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"d-block\">ທ່ານມີໂພສທີ່ລໍຖ້າການອະນຸມັດ</b>\n"
"                        ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຜູ້ຄວບຄຸມກວດສອບໂພສກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຂອງທ່ານ ກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດຕອບ"
"ຄຳຖາມໄດ້."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead either edit the "
"question or add a question comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍຄຳຖາມ</b>. ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄຳຖາມ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄຳເຫັນໃສ່ຄຳຖາມແທນ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead, either edit the "
"question or add a comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍຄຳຖາມ</b>. ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄຳຖາມ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄຳເຫັນແທນ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not comment other answers</b>. Instead add a comment on "
"the other answers."
msgstr "<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນອອກຄຳເຫັນໃສ່ຄຳຕອບອື່ນ</b>. ໃຫ້ຂຽນຄຳເຫັນໃສ່ຄຳຕອບນັ້ນແທນ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not start debates</b> This community Q&amp;A is not a "
"discussion group. Please avoid holding debates in your answers as they tend "
"to dilute the essence of questions and answers. For brief discussions please "
"use commenting facility."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນເລີ່ມການໂຕ້ວາທີ</b> ພາກສ່ວນຖາມ-ຕອບຂອງຊຸມຊົນນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນກຸ່ມສົນທະນາ. ກະລຸນາຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໂ"
"ຕ້ວາທີໃນຄຳຕອບຂອງທ່ານ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກຂອງຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ຄຳຕອບຫຼຸດລົງ. ສຳລັບການສົນທະນາສັ້ນໆ "
"ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ລະບົບການອອກຄຳເຫັນ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other Questions</b>. Instead add a "
"question comment indication \"Possible duplicate of...\". However, it's ok "
"to include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນພຽງແຕ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາຄຳຖາມອື່ນ</b>. ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄຳເຫັນໃນຄຳຖາມແທນວ່າ \"ອາດຈະຊ້ຳຊ້ອນກັ"
"ບ...\". ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສາມາດແນບລິ້ງຫາຄຳຖາມ ຫຼື ຄຳຕອບອື່ນທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other questions</b>.Instead add a comment "
"indicating <i>\"Possible duplicate of...\"</i>. However, it's fine to "
"include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນພຽງແຕ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາຄຳຖາມອື່ນ</b>. ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄຳເຫັນແທນວ່າ <i>\"ອາດຈະຊ້ຳຊ້ອນກັບ...\"</i>"
". ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສາມາດແນບລິ້ງຫາຄຳຖາມ ຫຼື ຄຳຕອບອື່ນທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just provide a link a solution</b>. Instead provide the "
"solution description text in your answer, even if it's just a copy/paste. "
"Links are welcome, but should be complementary to answer, referring sources "
"or additional reading."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຕອບບໍ່ຄວນໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ລິ້ງແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ</b>. ຄວນອະທິບາຍວິທີແກ້ໄຂໃນຄຳຕອບຂອງທ່ານນຳ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເ"
"ປັນການກັອບປີ້ມາວາງກໍຕາມ. ທ່ານສາມາດແນບລິ້ງໄດ້ ແຕ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເປັນຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ, ອ້າງອີງແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ ຫຼື ອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີ"
"ມ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Before you ask - please make sure to search for a similar question.</b> "
"You can search questions by their title or tags. It’s also OK to answer your "
"own question."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກ່ອນຈະຖາມ - ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາຄຳຖາມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ.</b> ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຄຳຖາມຕ"
"າມຫົວຂໍ້ ຫຼື ແທັກ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕອບຄຳຖາມຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_forum.forum_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.default_faq
msgid ""
"<b>Please avoid asking questions that are too subjective and argumentative</"
"b> or not relevant to this community."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກະລຸນາຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຕັ້ງຄຳຖາມທີ່ເປັນຄວາມຄິດເຫັນສ່ວນຕົວເກີນໄປ, ກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດການໂຕ້ຖຽງ</b> ຫຼື ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັ"
"ບຊຸມຊົນນີ້."

#. module: website_forum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_forum.post_answer
msgid ""
"<b>Please try to give a substantial answer.</b> If you wanted to comment on "
"the question or answer, just\n"
"            <b>use the commenting tool.</b> Please remember that you can "
"always <b>revise your answers</b>\n"
"            - no need to answer the same question twice. Also, please "
"<b>don't forget to vote</b>\n"
"            - it really helps to select the best questions and answers!"
msgstr ""
"<b>ກະລຸນາພະຍາຍາມໃຫ້ຄຳຕອບທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຈະແຈ້ງ ແລະ ເປັນປະໂຫຍດ.</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອອກຄຳເຫັນໃສ່ຄຳ"
"ຖາມ ຫຼື ຄຳຕອບ, ພຽງແຕ່\n"
"            <b>ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືການອອກຄຳເຫັນ.</b> ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າທ່ານສາມາດ <b>ດັດແກ້ຄຳຕອບຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ</b> ໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ\n"
"            - ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕອບຄຳຖາມດຽວກັນສອງຄັ້ງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ກະລຸນາ <b>ຢ່າລືມລົງຄະແນນ</b>"
"\n"
"            - ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃນການຄັດເລືອກຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ຄຳຕອບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໄດ້ແທ້ໆ!"

